<title>USA: TransAmerican says Waste Inds ends talks.</title>
<headline>TransAmerican says Waste Inds ends talks.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>TransAmerican Waste Industries Inc said on Thursday Waste Industries Inc has elected not to accept TransAmerican's revised merger offer.</p>
<p>The new offer cut the number of shares involved to be issued in the deal, cutting the value to approximately $150 million, TransAmerican said.</p>
<p>The previous offer was $209 million in stock.</p>
</text>
